{"id": "mrs-angel", "status": "published", "category": "創業經歷", "title": "Mrs.Angel 台灣珍珠奶茶專賣店", "subtitle": "第一次實際參與餐飲創業後，我發現創業容易，經營難。", "cover": {"src": "/assets/experience/cover-mrs-angel.png", "width": 796, "height": 531, "scale": 1, "srcset": "/assets/responsive/cover-mrs-angel-b6e48a47100b-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/cover-mrs-angel-b6e48a47100b-796.webp 796w"}, "html": "<section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>從校園奶茶店開始</h3><p>我在日本讀大學時，原本是去應徵校園奶茶店的工作。和經營者交流時，我提出一些經營想法；對方希望我用具體提案說服他，我便寫了商業企劃，說明產品與經營方式可以如何調整。後來，我成為這間校園奶茶店的經理。</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline note-gallery-compact note-gallery-pair\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/campus-bubble-tea-press-release.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/campus-bubble-tea-press-release.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/campus-bubble-tea-press-release-b963d65a18f4-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/campus-bubble-tea-press-release-b963d65a18f4-532.webp 532w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"國士館大學校園奶茶店新聞稿，頁面日期為 2019 年 7 月 19 日。\" width=\"532\" height=\"718\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>國士館大學校園奶茶店新聞稿，頁面日期為 2019 年 7 月 19 日。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/campus-bubble-tea-feature.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/campus-bubble-tea-feature.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/campus-bubble-tea-feature-55f1940a1e2d-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/campus-bubble-tea-feature-55f1940a1e2d-800.webp 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"介紹國士館大學香苑餐廳與校園奶茶店的報導頁面。\" width=\"800\" height=\"718\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>介紹國士館大學香苑餐廳與校園奶茶店的報導頁面。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-tea-drink-record.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-tea-drink-record.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/mrs-angel-tea-drink-record-30af16accf05-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/mrs-angel-tea-drink-record-30af16accf05-881.webp 881w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"奶茶飲品紀錄。\" width=\"881\" height=\"659\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>奶茶飲品紀錄。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-harvest-festival-2019.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-harvest-festival-2019.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/mrs-angel-harvest-festival-2019-aa8306da3730-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/mrs-angel-harvest-festival-2019-aa8306da3730-530.webp 530w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"收穫祭出攤與當時的社群貼文。\" width=\"530\" height=\"719\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>收穫祭出攤與當時的社群貼文。</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>把想法落實成一家店</h3><p>累積了海報製作與產品調整的經驗後，我們開始討論在經堂商店街開店，並共同參與 Mrs.Angel 的籌備與經營。依當時的經歷紀錄，從構想到開店約花了一個半月。</p><p>真正開始營運後，我才發現開店只是起點。員工排班、收銀系統與支付服務的簽約、原物料調整、稅務申報，以及損益計算，都需要逐一處理。</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline note-gallery-compact\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-kyodo-promotion.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-kyodo-promotion.png\" alt=\"經堂 Mrs.Angel 的飲品宣傳圖片。\" width=\"405\" height=\"411\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>經堂 Mrs.Angel 的飲品宣傳圖片。</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>季節變化與疫情</h3><p>入秋後，營業額明顯下降。我們發現，不能把台灣市場對奶茶的飲用習慣直接套到日本市場，季節也會影響顧客對產品的接受度。我們調整品項，加入芋圓等產品，也提早加入 Uber Eats。</p><p>後來疫情使實體來客進一步減少。提早加入外送平台，讓我們在衝擊擴大之前已有一定的外送客源，這是幫助店面度過難關的重要決定。</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline note-gallery-compact\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-chicken-delivery-listings.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-chicken-delivery-listings.png\" alt=\"同頁顯示 Mrs.Angel 與台灣惡魔雞排的外送平台截圖。\" width=\"404\" height=\"718\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>同頁顯示 Mrs.Angel 與台灣惡魔雞排的外送平台截圖。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-uber-eats-launch.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-uber-eats-launch.png\" alt=\"Uber Eats 外送設備與宣傳物料。\" width=\"471\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>Uber Eats 外送設備與宣傳物料。</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>創業容易，經營難</h3><p>這是我第一次實際參與餐飲創業。比起把店開起來，更困難的是每天持續調整產品、人力與成本，並在需求變化時找到能繼續經營的方法。這也是我後來理解營運與供應鏈問題的起點。</p></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>後續外送平台紀錄</h3><p>以下為較後期的店面與平台紀錄，其中營運統計涵蓋 2025 至 2026 年，與前述在校創業經歷分開呈現。</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline note-gallery-compact\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-platform-listing.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-platform-listing.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/mrs-angel-platform-listing-0cf38b850b1c-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/mrs-angel-platform-listing-0cf38b850b1c-578.webp 578w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"後續外送平台店面截圖。\" width=\"578\" height=\"718\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>後續外送平台店面截圖。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-top-eats.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-top-eats.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/mrs-angel-top-eats-0c0036b36541-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/mrs-angel-top-eats-0c0036b36541-849.webp 849w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"平台 Top Eats 頁面截圖，畫面標示 2026 年 5 月的評估期間。\" width=\"849\" height=\"389\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>平台 Top Eats 頁面截圖，畫面標示 2026 年 5 月的評估期間。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-operations-2025-2026.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-operations-2025-2026.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/mrs-angel-operations-2025-2026-53f45f9532f9-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/mrs-angel-operations-2025-2026-53f45f9532f9-848.webp 848w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"平台營運頁面截圖，統計期間為 2025 年 5 月 1 日至 2026 年 4 月 30 日。\" width=\"848\" height=\"378\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>平台營運頁面截圖，統計期間為 2025 年 5 月 1 日至 2026 年 4 月 30 日。</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>當時的影像紀錄</h3><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-compact\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-products.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-products.jpeg\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/mrs-angel-products-4c2199db3222-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/mrs-angel-products-4c2199db3222-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"Mrs.Angel 當時的飲品照片。\" width=\"1150\" height=\"927\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>Mrs.Angel 當時的飲品照片。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-storefront.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-storefront.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/mrs-angel-storefront-0e32ec47365e-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/mrs-angel-storefront-0e32ec47365e-659.webp 659w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"經堂商店街店面照片。\" width=\"659\" height=\"559\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>經堂商店街店面照片。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-interior.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-interior.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/mrs-angel-interior-c9ca27397461-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/mrs-angel-interior-c9ca27397461-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"Mrs.Angel 店內空間。\" width=\"1152\" height=\"861\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>Mrs.Angel 店內空間。</figcaption></figure></div></section>", "pending": "完整文章準備中。", "close": "關閉"}